--- !u!114 &1571515247
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1571515246}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b805decceafe68d449751737047ed31f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isHeart1IsCollect: 0
  isHeart2IsCollect: 0
  isHeart3IsCollect: 0
  shardOfHeart:
  - {fileID: 1030596788}
  - {fileID: 2058155738}
  - {fileID: 454314099}
  textAlam: {fileID: 1099978249}
  textName: {fileID: 112512296}
  animatorTextAlam: {fileID: 1099978248}
  heartsWordsCollect1:
  - id: 0
    actor: Young Kiara
    words: "hmmmm\u2026\u2026\u2026 | just a little more tweaking here\u2026\u2026\u2026
      | there. That feels right, i think?"
    isNext: 1
  - id: 1
    actor: Kiara
    words: "I guess I\u2026 used to be like this | doing things no one ever asked
      for | not to impress anyone |not to keep someone from drifting away. |Just
      because it made me\u2026 | happy. "
    isNext: 1
  - id: 2
    actor: Alam
    words: that joy was real Kiara | it came from you | long before anyone tried
      to claim it
    isNext: 0
  heartsWordsCollect2:
  - id: 0
    actor: Kiara
    words: "She looks so alive. | Like the world hasn\u2019t touched her yet. |Like
      she didn\u2019t know\u2026 | what it felt like to shape herself around someone
      else\u2019s expectations. "
    isNext: 1
  - id: 1
    actor: Alam
    words: "She wasn\u2019t performing. | She wasn\u2019t afraid. |She wasn\u2019t
      small. "
    isNext: 1
  - id: 2
    actor: Alam
    words: "That Joy | That Light | it wasn\u2019t something he gave you, Kiara.
      | It was something you already had. "
    isNext: 0
  heartsWordsCollect3:
  - id: 0
    actor: Young Kiara
    words: "Alright, which one\u2019s good for today? | Aha! The Chosen one |  Perfect!
      Ah\u2026 or maybe\u2026 that one?  "
    isNext: 1
  - id: 1
    actor: Kiara
    words: "i used to choose things so easily | so freely | Without that voice in
      my head whispering | Will he like it?\u201D |\u201CIs this what he wants?\u201D "
    isNext: 1
  - id: 2
    actor: Kiara
    words: "Back then\u2026 | my choices were mine. "
    isNext: 1
  - id: 3
    actor: Alam
    words: 'And they can be yours again. | All of them. '
    isNext: 0
  wordsAtStart:
  - id: 0
    actor: Kiara
    words: "Before I knew it, everything ended. | I\u2019m left all alone in this
      vast emptiness. | Was it a mistake to let him go? | Where am I supposed to
      go after this? | What do I do without him?"
    isNext: 1
  - id: 1
    actor: Alam
    words: 'The most straight and obvious paths are often the hardest. | But we can
      always slowly move forward  '
    isNext: 1
  - id: 2
    actor: Kiara
    words: 'But where does it lead me to? '
    isNext: 1
  - id: 3
    actor: Alam
    words: To yourself
    isNext: 1
  - id: 4
    actor: Kiara
    words: "Myself? | I don\u2019t even know what that is. | I only knew his version
      of me. | What he liked, what he wanted. | Everything I was, existed because
      of him."
    isNext: 0
  wordsAtLabyrinth:
  - id: 0
    actor: Alam
    words: 'Your mind might feel like a labyrinth right now. | But people always
      find their way in it, | and so could you. '
    isNext: 1
  - id: 1
    actor: Alam
    words: "Not everything will make sense at first. | That\u2019s why we need to
      thread slowly, | piece by piece. "
    isNext: 0
